WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.740
A child is born into a
low-income family in France.

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.680
How long could it take
to reach average income?

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.510
In 2018, an OECD study made an estimate.

4
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.120
Not six years.

5
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.530
It could take six generations.

6
00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:15.880
The French have a phrase for it.

7
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.130
«L'ascenseur social» is «en panne».

8
00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.730
More than one person in
seven in France lives

9
00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.920
below «le seuil de pauvreté».

10
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.580
Who are they, why, and
what actually helps?

11
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.960
In this mission, you'll see how
France draws its poverty line,

12
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.690
and who falls below it.

13
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.670
Then you'll weigh who should act:

14
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:38.550
the State, or associations
like «les Restos du Cœur».

15
00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.740
Your mission: find out
who is poor in France,

16
00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.040
why, and what really helps.
